# The set of files whose bytes the firmware ELF is a function of. This is the ONLY definition: it is
# read by scripts/elf-inputs-digest.sh, which firmware/build.rs runs to embed the digest in .asp.prov
# and which firmware/Makefile and the elf-check side use to compute it again. Do not restate this
# list anywhere else.
#
# Paths are relative to firmware/. One directive per line: `path <p>` (a file or a directory that is
# searched), `name <glob>` (which file names inside searched directories count as inputs, applied to
# every `path`), `prune <dirname>` (a directory name never entered, so build products are not
# mistaken for sources). The PATHS are part of the digest: adding or renaming a file changes it,
# refreshing every mtime in the tree does not.
path src
path build.rs
path memory.x
path Cargo.toml
path Cargo.lock
path ../crates

name *.rs
name *.x
name Cargo.toml
name Cargo.lock

prune target
